{
  "slug": "pm-ai-partner-framework",
  "name": "Pm Ai Partner Framework",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered skills for Product Managers — 10 agent modes for thinking, writing, analyzing, building, and decision-making. Includes 4 workflow commands (/pm:plan-week, /pm:write-brief, /pm:prep-meeting, /pm:audit-codebase) and 3 automation hooks (quality gate, draft status, commit reminder). Turn Claude into your PM thinking partner.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**, **1 command** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `builder` (Hands-on implementation partner for creating tools, scripts, dashboards, and prototypes), `competitor-analyst` (Competitive analysis and market positioning partner for Product Managers), `data-analyst` (Data exploration and analysis partner for Product Managers), `devil-advocate` (Constructive critic and stress-tester for ideas and proposals), `hypothesis-tester` (Structured hypothesis formulation, experiment design, and results interpretation for Product Managers), `meeting-prep` (Meeting preparation assistant for Product Managers), `product-brief` (Structured product brief and PRD creation assistant), `stakeholder-update` (Stakeholder communication assistant for status updates, progress reports, and executive summaries), and 5 more\n- **Commands** (1): `pm`\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pm-ai-partner-framework@claude-community` from `ahmedkhaledmohamed/PM-AI-Partner-Framework` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 13,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 1
  },
